{
  "voice": "voice-00",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "他逃上大西洋邮轮，以为这片海，能藏住自己。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "7518c1d28e1d3d2d0077462d16087b9bc419255fe3e82974af863e95b6b64e8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "可一道电波，已经跑在了他的前面。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "61c4de0bd2962fa34b197e3fd7a629a57c02a503e90c9ed1efa022a7b805c479"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "一九一零年一月三十一日，伦敦的小楼里，聚会正热闹。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "5ac6bdfe186cef7c7aba227e2c77237d2977986a3215e261470011da53d6ef9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "女歌手科拉放声高歌，丈夫克里平，却安静地坐在角落。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "d3c6e90f8e775c1e7a894b9fc1d8dac2201aeb472c978dc7f71f6b039fb953fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "可聚会之后，科拉再没露面，只留下了她的舞台帽。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "5e6409c03bf9c65f771a0cda679fd7d474e6fa174fea5be3c05a19ac4b71d416"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "几周后，情人伊瑟尔住了进来，戴上科拉的首饰。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "c95e12ef4009284d770cf5c2f822b81c508e71c08e39edb6658824545eb6e8b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "丈夫先说科拉回了美国，后来又说她病死，朋友们起了疑心。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "a410e472bb600417328b39b29c343e4ee0789ef8226fcb09cbb86f5ee5d2f329"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "她们报了警，苏格兰场的杜探长，开始调查这场失踪。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "ac7246dd8644dd956398f31c17fbcb80a64707cbae9bd7e83d8076c1e8bd0882"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "探长上门，克里平温和应答，第一次搜查，一无所获。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "9030dbda1857e3d1c770a8c5ef492d9c0109f7c0ef6296d20094cb71c69f23cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "可调查之后，这对情人突然不见了。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "95f2f3012a4498198ff27a482915536ed1d34d6fdebe0f5524a36c137e874494"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "两人的消失，让探长折返回去，这次，他走向地下煤窖。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "b779e7c4500cd4bc7013102fb3ae6e5041aebd8f8da5ab2394139169fc7d050a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他撬开松动的砖地，看到地下的东西，脸色变得凝重。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "2057d616f322ebf170de3e076f040da1a260a37fdf5502780bd72eeed0883dc6"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "地下发现了遗骸，警方封锁现场。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "382c44e8a7844a7bf6f810cf368d929f0608360d84722620ec130589d47e51bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "检验发现了剧毒药物，警方随即发出通缉令。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "464e6aa31d3a21d48b7985d7d12352d8c849ea0b3308ce9e163e6b73280fa51b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "七月二十日，两人化名罗宾逊父子，登上蒙特罗斯号。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "32dbd95065f2a2e0f2a7f90b80a9931a0f852e8e24bdb5c5ab775aa098ce0e17"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "船长肯德尔，却留意上了这对举止奇怪的父子。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "960b6d61673781782f320de974b9e8b100a5f5e117027cc200eaf3062393cf6b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "男孩的裤脚靠别针固定，两人牵手的动作，又过分亲密。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "e4283322dcd5498c1ada5c0452d516d382d4d7d2a7d4b9e0e28da7677637edf7"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "船长翻开通缉报纸，认出了这对逃亡者。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "d092ca6e67f0d1064659132087862e5c4ce353e4d75c3c00521ca160d9587bd2"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "他让电报员向英国发报，一道电波，越过了大西洋。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "591446c820c01899d496009055feacda63121095e94aab1fca7e2b9787d7315e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "线索送到警方手里，杜探长立即出发。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "0d0442356992ee469d6f2e1cc6e0c55e9b76eda3965cdd84fa8c8e5a89bd5290"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "他登上更快的劳伦蒂克号，要赶在两人前面。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "65980e3015114c9652ebd0ab1e59426d0b56810f831101f7429328e22905a85c"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "一边还在悠闲看海，另一边，已经抢先抵达加拿大。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "cc2fd84d7aed07f923a3401f888d02e93948b3c9a747b1ae3ade093127bfa011"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "七月三十一日清晨，探长换上引航员制服，在父亲角等候。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "f38dd31238cdddc66a4fb38d0cf91432f784b011957ab7984e9e7ccc77c2f212"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "小船靠上蒙特罗斯号，探长登船，走到毫无防备的克里平身后。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "fa429e46800799645ad4a8046dcb3aba59316170dc8b5f268cc3849c82a0debe"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "帽子摘下，这场跨海逃亡，终于结束了。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "7b3a91774be0bf039b97b153a62ff6fb123e2bbfb8d7d8569971b8f0d55fd044"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "十月，克里平在老贝利受审，陪审团开始商议判决。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "1cda90ca5743f9f8a05d6a9c1e358e054ed5302482114f491e42c4d690c34dde"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "仅二十七分钟，他被裁定有罪。伊瑟尔另案受审，无罪。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "2fe49d498b197880c1b43672120057a73b51dc9c79df8e0929bfbd6925eb4d18"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "十一月二十三日，克里平被处决，故事似乎画上了句号。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "d0fb3074ef699b86349ecc56360e111e5c14eb8b5df8e91d853ebca43792fddb"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "可二〇〇七年的DNA研究提出：地窖里的人，可能不是科拉。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "5e16e5870513f233452f26927ac8197f8194d8f330a579564697042b81c6ceb5"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "结论仍有争议，原判未改。科拉，究竟在哪？",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": "34af4c4eeeed6af2843da53f88ebbfaca42b93ac9ed3b487db4634cd92574130"
    }
  ]
}
